  "intuition": "This loss combines advantage signals and cost gaps in a pairwise manner, encouraging the model to prioritize pairs where the advantage is high and the cost gap is low. The logsigmoid applied to advantage differences plus a scaled cost gap penalizes unfavorable pairs, promoting preferred outcomes in RL4CO settings.",
